invariant: INV-7
file: quic_initial.c
catches: quic_test
builds: bin/quic_test
reason: quic_initial_open derives an Initial key for a version this
  build holds no salt or labels for and opens under version 1's.
  test/quic_initial_tests.h requires CH_EINVAL with the packet unchanged
  for four such versions.

--- old
                      uint64_t *pn, size_t *pt_len) {
    if (!quic_version_derived(version)) {
        return CH_EINVAL;
    }
--- new
                      uint64_t *pn, size_t *pt_len) {
